Every section should feel like the next scene of a movie.\
\
Never make the website feel like a traditional marketing agency.\
\
Instead, present Genesis Nexa as a technology company specializing in business transformation.\
\
Genesis Nexa provides:\
\
\'95 Premium Websites\
\'95 AI Agents for WhatsApp\
\'95 AI Customer Support\
\'95 Business Automation\
\'95 CRM Integration\
\'95 Meta Ads\
\'95 Google Ads\
